},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:25:57]|h|r Ricket says: I'm telling ya, Skaggit. Somethin' called us from across the water. But when we arrived, it...it was eerie. Abandoned.",
["serverTime"] = 1743294356,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
3,
4,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121432.009,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:03]|h|r Skaggit says: Abandoned? Then there was no one on the end of this \"call?\"",
["serverTime"] = 1743294362,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
3,
4,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121438.885,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:07]|h|r Ricket says: Nope. Nobody. Zip. There was nothin' there but some big crystal.",
["serverTime"] = 1743294366,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
3,
4,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121442.832,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:12]|h|r Skaggit says: Crystal? Like a valuable crystal? At an abandoned mine? Ricky you're KILLIN' me. Why didn't ya nab some of it?",
["serverTime"] = 1743294371,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
3,
4,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121447.034,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:18]|h|r Ricket says: Hey, clouds were rollin' in and my gang was already on edge. We looked around then booked it outta there.",
["serverTime"] = 1743294377,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
3,
4,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121453.533,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:24]|h|r Skaggit mutters under his breath.",
["serverTime"] = 1743294384,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
17,
5,
6,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121459.788,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:27]|h|r Skaggit says: If ya heard it loud an' clear out to sea, I'm sure you're not the only one. We better get back out there fast if we want that crystal.",
["serverTime"] = 1743294387,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
3,
4,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121462.439,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:35]|h|r Ricket says: I heard Gazlowe's gettin' us a zeppelin--certainly faster than a boat! But that's gonna take awhile. You reckon I should reach out to the Greasemonkeys?",
["serverTime"] = 1743294395,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
3,
4,
["n"] = 3,
},
["timestamp"] = 121470.137,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
{
["message"] = "|cff979797|Hpratcopy|h[20:26:43]|h|r Skaggit says: Do it. See if we can get out there faster.",
["serverTime"] = 1743294403,
["r"] = 1,
["extraData"] = {
13,
